{"id":347,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"KVAで体験を重ねる家政学院中高","feature_description":"東京家政学院中学校・高等学校は、建学の精神KVAを基盤に、知識、豊かさ、表現の三面を育てる学校です。中学では体験を重視した学びとSDGsプログラム、高校では探究プログラムを通じて、主体的に深く学ぶ姿勢を養います。女子教育としての自立支援も明確です。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5765,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5766,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5767,"name":"バトントワリング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5768,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5769,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5770,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5771,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5772,"name":"料理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5773,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5774,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5775,"name":"POPS・軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5776,"name":"自然科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5777,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kasei-gakuin.ed.jp/life/club.html